### Requests of the realm owner: run user_auth.http first to get auth_token

### Create an organisation
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "globex",
  "emailDomains": ["globex.test"],
  "ownerEmail": "owner@globex.test",
  "ownerPassword": "changeme",
  "ownerFirstName": "Carol",
  "ownerLastName": "Globex"
}

### List organisations
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations?search=glo&max=20
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get an organisation
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Organisations with a product (catalog and product, or either alone)
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations?catalog=products-sandbox&product=shop-repository
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Members (allowed to the realm owner and to the org admins of globex)

### Add a member
# @name add_member
POST http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/members
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@globex.test",
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Smith"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("member_id", response.body.id);
%}

### List members
GET http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/members
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Remove a member
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/members/{{member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### User groups (allowed to the realm owner and to the org admins of globex)

### Create a user group
POST http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/user-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "support"
}

### List the user groups, with their members
GET http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/user-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Put a member in a user group
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/user-groups/support/members/{{member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Take a member out of a user group
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/user-groups/support/members/{{member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete a user group
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/organisations/globex/user-groups/support
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Catalogs (realm owner)

### Create a catalog
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "products-sandbox",
  "displayName": "Sandbox",
  "description": "Test environment"
}

### List the catalogs
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get a catalog
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Rename a catalog (its name cannot change)
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Sandbox EU",
  "description": "Test environment, Europe"
}

### Products of a catalog (realm owner)

### Create a product, with its features and a parameter
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "shop-repository",
  "displayName": "Shop repository",
  "features": [{"name": "search", "displayName": "Search engine"}, {"name": "dig"}],
  "params": [{"name": "region", "type": "ENUM", "required": true, "defaultValue": "eu", "values": ["eu", "us"]}]
}

### List the products of the catalog
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Add a feature to the product (or rename it)
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/shop-repository/features/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Export"
}

### Remove a feature of the product (the orgs that bought it lose it)
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/shop-repository/features/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Catalog roles (realm owner)

### Create a catalog role the org admins may grant
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "searcher",
  "displayName": "Can search",
  "orgGrantable": true
}

### Create a catalog role reserved to the realm owner
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "anonymous",
  "description": "Test accounts, left out of the stats",
  "orgGrantable": false
}

### Grant it directly to a member of an org
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/roles/anonymous/users/{{member_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Who holds it directly
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/roles/anonymous/users
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Assignment to an organisation (realm owner)

### Assign a product to an organisation (again to change what it negotiated)
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/shop-repository
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quota": 1000,
  "cycle": "MONTHLY",
  "boughtFeatures": ["search"],
  "params": {"region": "us"}
}

### Create a metered product: a quota per metered feature, no quota of product
POST http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "billing",
  "displayName": "Billing repository",
  "features": [{"name": "read"}, {"name": "stats"}, {"name": "search", "metered": true}, {"name": "dig", "metered": true}]
}

### Assign the metered product: one quota per metered feature bought, no more, no less
PUT http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/billing
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boughtFeatures": ["read", "stats", "search", "dig"],
  "featureQuotas": {"search": {"quota": 200, "cycle": "DAILY"}, "dig": {"quota": 100, "cycle": "DAILY"}}
}

### List the products of an organisation, in every catalog
GET http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex/products
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Unassign a product
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/shop-repository
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete a product (409 while assigned)
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox/products/shop-repository
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete a catalog (409 while it has products or roles)
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/admin/catalogs/products-sandbox
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Delete the organisation
DELETE http://localhost:8282/api/admin/organisations/globex
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
